{"turn_id": "d24-t1", "session_id": "d24", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "training_dataset", "text": "他们在“Quora Question Pairs”公开基准数据集上进行实验，用于释义识别（paraphrase identification）任务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "general_benchmark_mention", "text": "论文结论中提到在基准数据集（benchmark datasets）上的实验结果验证了其理论，但未在结论中具体列出数据集名称。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-93293501afba2ed0cf8487d1"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d24-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d24-t2", "session_id": "d24", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "dataset_task", "text": "论文在公开基准数据集“Quora Question Pairs”上进行释义识别（paraphrase identification）任务的实验。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "results_outperform", "text": "实验结果表明，该模型大幅且显著地优于其他基线。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "verifies_theory", "text": "作者称实验结果验证了其关于对齐后不匹配部分（aligned unmatched parts）的理论，并说明了方法的有效性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "contribution_verification", "text": "在贡献陈述中，作者称模型大幅优于其他基线，验证了其理论与方法的有效性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "abstract_claim", "text": "摘要称大量实验表明该模型显著优于其他最先进的基线。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-e02ebd81f0f8210ef85fd8bf"}]}, {"key": "model_steps", "text": "模型分为三步：先用BiLSTM将输入句子解析为隐藏表示，再由Hungarian层利用隐藏表示抽取对齐的不匹配部分，最后用余弦相似度度量这些部分以做最终判别。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "abstract_pipeline", "text": "摘要所述流程为：BiLSTM解析句子，Hungarian层对齐匹配位置，再由另一个BiLSTM将对齐结果转换为soft-max回归的输入。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-e02ebd81f0f8210ef85fd8bf"}]}, {"key": "dynamic_graph", "text": "训练时修改双向反向传播：前向传播中由Hungarian层确定对齐关系并据此动态构建计算图，之后反向传播可按常规图进行。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-70876748d6ad7c5c4f480427"}]}, {"key": "end_to_end", "text": "通过动态构建计算图的方式，优化框架仍能以端到端方式调整神经架构参数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1712.02555", "chunk_id": "c-f1c9938e8916274c07715a88"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d24-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
